  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、何に悩んでるんだ？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000610020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ……いえ。仕事やレッスンの反省点を\r\nまとめていただけです。他に何かないかと考えていて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100061/1002001000610020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（おお、ノートに反省点が\r\nびっしり書いてあるな……）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "良かった点も書こう",
    "nextLabel": "1002001000611"
  },
  {
    "select": "手伝おうか",
    "nextLabel": "1002001000612"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "まだまだ\r\n反省点はあるぞ！",
    "nextLabel": "1002001000613"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000610030,
    "label": "1002001000611",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あっ……そうですね。私、悪いところばっかり……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100061/1002001000610030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000610040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "次に生かすために、いいところも書くようにします\r\nありがとうございます、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100061/1002001000610040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000610050,
    "label": "1002001000612",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうしてもらえると助かります。ひとりだけだと、\r\nどうしても偏ってしまうので……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100061/1002001000610050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000610060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーの意見もあると嬉しいです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100061/1002001000610060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000610070,
    "label": "1002001000613",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そんなこと、言われなくてもわかってます",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100200100061/1002001000610070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001000610080,
